[gd_resource type="Theme" format=3]

; Milestone 25 (documentation/ui_specification_v1.md, user, 18 Nov 2026): the look of every screen,
; the same by day and by night (decision 84). Nunito Bold (decision 88). Buttons look pressable: a
; white body with a thickness under it that moves down when pressed (the four big buttons are
; drawn by scripts/ui/action_button.gd; type ActionButton hides the normal drawing). Information is
; flat: the HUD and the clock capsule (HudPanel, Capsule) are a thin white line and a 5% white fill;
; bars are a see-through blue-grey with a light fill (cyan for XP). The speech balloon is white with
; a navy outline. Colours are the tokens of scripts/ui/ui_style.gd.

[ext_resource type="FontVariation" path="res://assets/fonts/nunito/nunito_bold.tres" id="1_font"]

